      Comprehensive documentation and user guide for formatting, validating, comparing, and converting JSON payloads online with zero-trust local browser security.
    </p>
  </div>

  <!-- Content Section 1: Introduction & Overview -->
  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-8 items-start mb-12">
    <div class="lg:col-span-7 bg-canvas-soft/80 dark:bg-canvas-soft/20 border border-hairline rounded-xl p-6 sm:p-8 space-y-4">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-mono text-link font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider">
        <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-link animate-pulse"></span>
        Overview
      </div>
      <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-ink tracking-tight">
        What is a JSON Formatter and Validator?
      </h3>
      <p class="text-body text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed">
        In modern software engineering, API development, and data architecture, raw JSON strings are often minified into single-line blobs to optimize network bandwidth. While efficient for machine processing, unformatted JSON is virtually unreadable for humans. A modern <strong>json formatter</strong> solves this problem by parsing raw text and reformatting it into a structured, readable hierarchy with customizable indentations.
      </p>
      <p class="text-body text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed">
        Whether you require an instant <strong>json formatter online</strong> for quick payload inspection or a reliable <strong>online json formatter</strong> for daily workflow optimization, <strong>jsonformatterai.com</strong> delivers the <strong>best json formatter</strong> experience. Equipped with a dual-engine parser, our application operates as both a <strong>json formatter and validator</strong>, ensuring your data strictly adheres to RFC 8259 standards while automatically flagging syntax errors, missing brackets, or bad quotes in real time.
      </p>
      <p class="text-body text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed">
        As a completely <strong>free json formatter</strong>, this utility requires no registration, zero downloads, and imposes no usage limits. Our <strong>pretty json formatter</strong> engine transforms nested arrays and object keys into visually intuitive tree nodes, empowering developers to debug data faster.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Right Side Feature Highlight Card -->
    <div class="lg:col-span-5 bg-canvas border border-hairline rounded-xl p-6 sm:p-8 space-y-5 shadow-sm">
      <h4 class="text-base font-semibold text-ink flex items-center gap-2">
        <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-link" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2">
          <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m6 2a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z" />
        </svg>
        Key Technical Advantages
      </h4>
      <ul class="space-y-3.5 text-xs sm:text-sm text-body">
        <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
          <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-link mt-2 shrink-0"></span>
