        </li>
        <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
          <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-violet mt-2 shrink-0"></span>
          <span><strong>AI Error Repair:</strong> Uses automated heuristic rules to repair broken single quotes, trailing commas, and unquoted object keys.</span>
        </li>
        <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
