          <span><strong>Multi-Format Converter:</strong> Export JSON into CSV, XML, YAML, and TypeScript interface definitions instantly.</span>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Content Section 2: Core Toolset & Features -->
  <div class="mb-12">
    <div class="text-center max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-8">
      <h3 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-ink tracking-tight mb-2">
        Comprehensive Features of Our AI JSON Formatter Tool
      </h3>
      <p class="text-body text-xs sm:text-sm">
        Explore how our multi-functional <strong>json formatter tool</strong> accelerates developer productivity across debugging, formatting, and structural comparison.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
      <!-- Feature Card 1 -->
      <div class="bg-canvas-soft/60 dark:bg-canvas-soft/10 border border-hairline rounded-xl p-5 hover:border-link/40 transition-colors duration-200">
        <div class="w-9 h-9 rounded-lg bg-link-bg-soft/50 dark:bg-link-bg-soft/10 border border-link/20 flex items-center justify-center text-link font-bold text-sm mb-3">
          AI
        </div>
        <h4 class="text-base font-semibold text-ink mb-2">AI JSON Formatter & Syntax Repair</h4>
        <p class="text-body text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed">
          Encountering invalid JSON from external APIs or log streams? Our intelligent <strong>ai json formatter</strong> identifies missing brackets, unquoted string keys, and illegal trailing commas, fixing syntax faults with a single click.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Feature Card 2 -->
      <div class="bg-canvas-soft/60 dark:bg-canvas-soft/10 border border-hairline rounded-xl p-5 hover:border-link/40 transition-colors duration-200">
        <div class="w-9 h-9 rounded-lg bg-violet-soft/50 dark:bg-violet-soft/10 border border-violet/20 flex items-center justify-center text-violet font-bold text-sm mb-3">
          Diff
        </div>
        <h4 class="text-base font-semibold text-ink mb-2">Side-by-Side JSON Compare & Diff</h4>
        <p class="text-body text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed">
          Need to compare two payload versions? Our built-in <strong>json compare</strong> workspace allows you to <strong>compare json</strong> structures side-by-side, generating a color-coded line-by-line <strong>json diff</strong> for fast conflict resolution.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Feature Card 3 -->
      <div class="bg-canvas-soft/60 dark:bg-canvas-soft/10 border border-hairline rounded-xl p-5 hover:border-link/40 transition-colors duration-200">
        <div class="w-9 h-9 rounded-lg bg-cyan-soft/50 dark:bg-cyan-soft/10 border border-cyan-deep/20 flex items-center justify-center text-cyan-deep font-bold text-sm mb-3">
          Conv
        </div>
        <h4 class="text-base font-semibold text-ink mb-2">Multi-Format JSON Converter</h4>
        <p class="text-body text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed">
          Transform your data between formats seamlessly. Our high-performance <strong>json converter</strong> converts JSON into clean CSV data, XML structures, YAML configs, and TypeScript interfaces without data loss.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Feature Card 4 -->
