        <div class="w-9 h-9 rounded-lg bg-warning-soft/50 dark:bg-warning-soft/10 border border-warning/20 flex items-center justify-center text-warning-deep dark:text-warning font-bold text-sm mb-3">
          Lint
        </div>
        <h4 class="text-base font-semibold text-ink mb-2">JSON Formatter & Validator Engine</h4>
        <p class="text-body text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed">
          Validate JSON schema compliance instantly. Our dual <strong>json formatter & validator</strong> highlights accurate character line offsets and error messages so you can fix invalid inputs immediately.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Feature Card 5 -->
