        <div class="w-9 h-9 rounded-lg bg-link-bg-soft/50 dark:bg-link-bg-soft/10 border border-link/20 flex items-center justify-center text-link font-bold text-sm mb-3">
          Txt
        </div>
        <h4 class="text-base font-semibold text-ink mb-2">Smart Text to JSON Formatter</h4>
        <p class="text-body text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed">
          Parse raw logs, escaped strings, and key-value pairs easily. Our versatile <strong>text to json formatter</strong> parses unstructured string inputs into structured, formatted JSON trees effortlessly.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Feature Card 6 -->
