        <div class="w-9 h-9 rounded-lg bg-link-bg-soft/50 dark:bg-link-bg-soft/10 border border-link/20 flex items-center justify-center text-link font-bold text-sm mb-3">
          PWA
        </div>
        <h4 class="text-base font-semibold text-ink mb-2">Chrome Extension & Offline Use</h4>
        <p class="text-body text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed">
          Need a lightweight alternative to a heavy <strong>json formatter chrome extension</strong>? Our Web Application works 100% offline as a Progressive Web App, giving you zero-delay formatting anywhere.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Content Section 3: Practical Code Example -->
  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-8 items-center mb-12 bg-canvas border border-hairline rounded-xl p-6 sm:p-8">
    <div class="lg:col-span-6 space-y-4">
      <div class="text-xs font-mono text-link font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider">Practical Guide</div>
      <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-ink tracking-tight">
        How to Use the Free Online JSON Formatter (JSON Formatter Example)
      </h3>
      <p class="text-body text-sm leading-relaxed">
        Using our <strong>free online json formatter</strong> is straightforward. Whether you are using a desktop browser or mobile device, our <strong>json formatter online free</strong> workspace delivers immediate formatting results:
      </p>
      <ol class="space-y-2 text-xs sm:text-sm text-body list-decimal list-inside">
        <li><strong>Paste Input:</strong> Paste your unformatted string or minified payload into the left input window.</li>
        <li><strong>Automated Repair:</strong> If syntax errors exist, click the AI Repair button to automatically fix quotes and trailing commas.</li>
        <li><strong>Format & Inspect:</strong> Select your preferred indent spacing (2 spaces, 4 spaces, or tabs) to generate interactive pretty JSON.</li>
        <li><strong>Export or Convert:</strong> Copy the formatted output, download the clean file, or convert it to CSV/YAML.</li>
      </ol>
      <p class="text-body text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed pt-2">
        Below is a standard <strong>json formatter example</strong> demonstrating how minified API response data is converted into clean, human-readable structure:
      </p>
